  "source": "https://gc.nh.gov/rsa/html/LXIII/655/655-11.htm",
  "statuteText": "655:11 Notice to Town and City Clerks. –\n\nAt least 100 days before the time of holding any primary, the secretary of state shall prepare and distribute to each town and city clerk in the state a notice in writing designating the offices for which candidates are to be nominated and that delegates to the state convention are to be elected."
